"Android apps and games are compiled while they run, which needs memory that can be written and then run. iOS only allows that while a debugger is attached to the app. Turning on JIT attaches one for a moment. Without it, Husk can show your library but cannot start Android or a game." = "安卓应用和游戏会在运行时编译代码，需要可写入、随后又可执行的内存。iOS 只有在调试器附加到应用时才允许这样做。开启 JIT 会短暂附加调试器；未开启时，Husk 可以显示应用库，但无法启动安卓系统或游戏。";
"Android can't start without JIT" = "未开启 JIT，无法启动安卓";
"Android cannot reshape a screen once it is running, so a landscape game on a portrait screen gets letterboxed into a band and looks tiny. Creating it landscape is the only way it can fill it — portrait apps are letterboxed instead. Costs one cold boot." = "安卓运行后无法改变屏幕形状，横屏游戏在竖屏内会缩成带黑边的狭窄区域。以横屏启动可让游戏铺满屏幕，竖屏应用则显示黑边。更改后需要冷启动一次。";
"Android draws on the real GPU through Metal — about four times the frame rate. This is the default." = "安卓通过 Metal 使用真实 GPU 渲染，帧率通常明显更高，这是默认选项。";
