"Open Husk to retry" = "打开 Husk 以重试";
"Open StikDebug on its own and check that it has your pairing file and that LocalDevVPN is connected. Update StikDebug to the latest release. Husk sends StikDebug its script itself, so nothing needs setting up for Husk inside StikDebug." = "请单独打开 StikDebug，确认已导入配对文件、LocalDevVPN 已连接，并更新到最新版本。Husk 会自行把所需脚本发送给 StikDebug，无需在 StikDebug 中另行配置 Husk。";
"Open its page in the Library. Husk says why it stopped:\n• **Protected app:** it checks that it is on a real Android phone, or uses anti-cheat or DRM. Husk does not get around these.\n• **Wrong kind of CPU code:** the APK only has x86 or another non-ARM architecture. Find an ARM (arm64-v8a or armeabi-v7a) version.\n• **Incomplete app or missing game data:** the APK needs its split files or an OBB. Import the full .apks, .xapk or .apkm.\n• **Needs Google:** the app requires a Google account or Play services Husk cannot provide.\n• **Uses something Husk does not have yet:** share the report so it can be added." = "在应用库中打开它的详情页，Husk 会说明停止原因：\n• **受保护的应用：** 检测真实安卓手机，或使用反作弊、DRM。Husk 不会绕过这些保护。\n• **处理器架构不兼容：** APK 只包含 x86 等非 ARM 代码，请获取 ARM（arm64-v8a 或 armeabi-v7a）版本。\n• **应用不完整或缺少数据：** 需要分包或 OBB，请导入完整的 .apks、.xapk 或 .apkm。\n• **需要 Google：** 应用依赖 Husk 无法提供的 Google 账号或 Play 服务。\n• **使用了尚未实现的功能：** 请分享报告，帮助开发者添加支持。";
"Open the app's page in your Library and tap **Share Report**. For Husk's own log, go to Settings › About › **Open Console**. Turning on **Developer Info** there adds more detail." = "在应用库中打开应用详情页，点击 **分享报告**。Husk 自身的日志位于 设置 › 关于 › **打开控制台**；开启 **开发者信息** 后可以记录更多细节。";
