"Tap **Check setup**. Husk checks LocalDevVPN and prepares the Developer Disk Image." = "点击 **检查配置**，Husk 会检查 LocalDevVPN 并准备开发者磁盘映像。";
"Tap **Choose pairing file** and pick it." = "点击 **选择配对文件** 并选择该文件。";
"Tap **Connect LocalDevVPN**. It switches the VPN on and comes straight back to Husk." = "点击 **连接 LocalDevVPN**，它会开启 VPN 并立即返回 Husk。";
"Tap **Enable JIT**. Husk's helper attaches and Android can start." = "点击 **启用 JIT**，Husk 的助手会附加，之后即可启动安卓。";
"Tap **Start pairing** in Husk first and allow **Local Network** access when asked. If you said no earlier, turn it on in Settings › Privacy & Security › Local Network › Husk. Wi-Fi has to be on. Developer Mode must already be enabled, which restarts the iPhone the first time." = "先在 Husk 中点击 **开始配对**，并在提示时允许 **本地网络** 访问。如果之前拒绝过，请前往 设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 本地网络 › Husk 开启权限。Wi-Fi 和开发者模式都必须开启；首次开启开发者模式会重启 iPhone。";
"Tap + and pick a fake package (.pkg), a folder of packages, or an extracted game folder (eboot.bin and sce_sys). Husk installs it into PS4 Games in Files, and an update package goes beside the game it updates. Retail packages are locked to a PS4 and do not install. PS4 games need iOS 17.4 or later." = "点击 +，选择解密的软件包（.pkg）、软件包文件夹，或已提取的游戏文件夹（包含 eboot.bin 和 sce_sys）。Husk 会将其安装到“文件”中的 PS4 游戏目录；更新包会放在对应游戏旁。零售软件包与 PS4 绑定，无法安装。PS4 游戏需要 iOS 17.4 或更高版本。";
"Tap + to add an Android APK or bundle (.xapk, .apkm, .apks), or a PS4 game: a fake package (.pkg), a folder of them, or an extracted game folder. You can also share files to Husk from Files or Safari." = "点击 + 添加安卓 APK、应用包（.xapk、.apkm、.apks）或 PS4 游戏：fake package（.pkg）、包含安装包的文件夹或已解压的游戏文件夹。也可以从“文件”或 Safari 分享到 Husk。";
