"The app crashed" = "应用已崩溃";
"The app refused to run here" = "应用拒绝在此环境运行";
"The app's video is DRM-protected (Widevine), which only certified Android devices can decrypt. Unprotected video plays; protected video stays black." = "此应用的视频受到 DRM（Widevine）保护，只有经过认证的安卓设备才能解密。未受保护的视频可以播放，受保护的视频会保持黑屏。";
"The certificate could not be saved in the Keychain." = "无法将证书保存到钥匙串。";
"The compatibility list could not be reached." = "无法连接兼容性列表。";
"The debugger is attached but is not answering trap requests, and this device will not execute a MAP_JIT mapping either, so no executable memory could be claimed. This is what happens when Husk runs inside another container app rather than sideloaded on its own." = "调试器已附加，但未响应陷阱请求；此设备也无法执行 MAP_JIT 映射，因此无法分配可执行内存。在其他容器应用中运行 Husk，而非独立侧载安装时，可能出现此问题。";
"The downloaded image did not match the release. Tap to retry." = "下载的镜像与发布版本不一致，请点击重试。";
"The first check downloads and mounts Apple's Developer Disk Image, which can take a minute." = "首次检查会下载并挂载 Apple 的开发者磁盘映像，可能需要一分钟。";
"The first launch of a big game prepares its code and data, and can take up to a minute. If it is still black after that, close it, open it once more and share the report if nothing changes." = "大型游戏首次启动时需要准备代码和数据，可能耗时约一分钟。如果之后仍然黑屏，请关闭并重新打开一次；仍无变化时请分享报告。";
"The first start downloads the Android image and boots it from cold, which takes a few minutes. After that Husk restores a saved machine, which is much faster." = "首次启动需要下载系统镜像并冷启动，耗时数分钟。之后 Husk 会恢复保存的系统状态，速度会明显加快。";
