"The game crashed" = "游戏已崩溃";
"The game exited" = "游戏已退出";
"The game has ended." = "游戏已结束。";
"The game starts with nothing over it: no bar, no controller, no readout. Tap with three fingers at once to bring the bar back, and again to hide it. The Hide button in the bar does the same while playing." = "游戏启动时不显示工具栏、虚拟手柄或状态信息。三指同时轻触可显示工具栏，再次轻触可隐藏。游玩时工具栏的“隐藏”按钮作用相同。";
"The helper did not attach within 90 seconds. Check that LocalDevVPN is connected, then try again." = "助手未在 90 秒内附加。请检查 LocalDevVPN 是否已连接，然后重试。";
"The language Husk and the apps and games in it use, from the next time Husk opens." = "Husk 及其内部应用和游戏所用的语言，将在下次打开 Husk 时生效。";
"The list is written to disk, so it is on screen before Android has finished starting." = "列表会保存到磁盘，因此安卓尚未启动完成时就能显示。";
"The panel is built when the machine starts, so a change costs one cold boot, and the next save replaces the machine saved at the old size — changing back costs another. Sizes are rounded to a multiple of eight. Bigger is slower: every pixel is drawn by an emulated phone. Android's density does not change with the panel, so a larger one shows more rather than bigger." = "屏幕在虚拟机启动时创建，因此更改后需要冷启动，下次保存会覆盖旧尺寸的状态；改回也需要再次冷启动。尺寸会取整为 8 的倍数。分辨率越高越慢，而安卓显示密度不会随屏幕改变，因此更大的尺寸会显示更多内容，而非放大内容。";
"The request for Husk's JIT helper could not be encoded." = "无法编码发送给 Husk JIT 助手的请求。";
"The runtime could not start it. The report says which part was missing." = "运行时无法启动此游戏。报告中说明了缺少的组件。";
"The screen stays black" = "画面一直黑屏";
"The store's answer had no certificate in it." = "商店的回复中没有证书。";
"The store's certificate could not be opened. If you have a .p12, import that with the password you set when you exported it." = "无法打开商店证书。如果有 .p12 文件，请导入并输入导出时设置的密码。";
"There are no APKs in that bundle." = "这个应用包中没有 APK。";
"There is no screen to show the file picker on." = "没有可用于显示文件选择器的界面。";
"This APK has no ARM code Husk can run, so it will probably not start." = "此 APK 不包含 Husk 可运行的 ARM 代码，因此可能无法启动。";
"This app is published in several pieces (split APKs) and only its base was imported, so its libraries or resources are missing. Import the whole bundle (.apks, .xapk or .apkm), or get it from Husk's store." = "此应用由多个分包（split APK）组成，但只导入了基础包，因此缺少库或资源。请导入完整应用包（.apks、.xapk 或 .apkm），或从 Husk 商店获取。";
"This app only works signed in to a Google account. It asked Android to pick one, and Husk has no Google accounts to offer, so the app closed." = "此应用只有登录 Google 账号才能使用。它请求安卓选择账号，但 Husk 没有可提供的 Google 账号，因此应用已退出。";
"This app relies on Google Play services (Google sign-in, Google's account and device checks) for more than Husk can answer for. Apps that only use Google's libraries run; this one stops without the real services." = "此应用需要的 Google Play 服务（Google 登录、账号和设备验证等）超出了 Husk 的支持范围。只使用 Google 库的应用可以运行，但此应用离不开真正的服务。";
"This certificate has expired. Refresh Husk in your store, then import its certificate again." = "此证书已过期。请在侧载商店中刷新 Husk，然后重新导入证书。";
"This copy of Husk doesn't have the PS4 layer." = "此版本的 Husk 不包含 PS4 转译层。";
"This device closed the connection, which usually means it no longer accepts Husk's pairing. Pair again, and check that LocalDevVPN is connected." = "此设备关闭了连接，通常表示它已不再接受 Husk 的配对。请重新配对，并确认 LocalDevVPN 已连接。";
"This device is jailbroken, so JIT comes from the jailbreak's Allow JIT in Apps setting." = "检测到此设备已越狱，请在越狱工具中开启“Allow JIT in Apps”。";
"This file is not an app Husk can read" = "Husk 无法读取此应用文件";
"This game keeps most of its data in an expansion file (OBB) that the Play Store downloads separately from the app. Husk installed the app itself but not that file, so the game cannot load." = "此游戏的大部分数据保存在由 Play 商店单独下载的扩展文件（OBB）中。Husk 已安装应用本体，但没有这个文件，因此游戏无法加载。";
"This iPhone only lets an app run translated code while a debugger enables JIT for it. Open Husk through StikDebug, or tap Turn On JIT in Husk, then start the app again." = "iPhone 需要调试器为应用开启 JIT，才能运行转译后的代码。请通过 StikDebug 打开 Husk，或点击 Husk 中的“开启 JIT”，然后重试。";
"This installation can only wait about 30 seconds in the background, so go to Settings straight away." = "此次安装在后台只能等待约 30 秒，请立即前往系统设置。";
"This is Geode's Android launcher. On Husk, Geode runs inside Geometry Dash instead: turn it on here (or in Geometry Dash's settings, under Mods), then start Geometry Dash and use Geode's button on its main menu to get mods. This APK supplies a library Geode needs, so keep it." = "这是 Geode 的安卓启动器。在 Husk 中，Geode 直接在 Geometry Dash 内运行：请在此处（或 Geometry Dash 设置的“模组”中）启用，然后启动 Geometry Dash，点击主菜单中的 Geode 按钮获取模组。此 APK 提供 Geode 所需的库，请保留。";
"This is a whole operating system — be patient" = "正在启动完整的操作系统，请耐心等待";
"This is the emulator. It's slow and it crashes. Don't use it for games." = "这是完整安卓模拟器，运行较慢且可能崩溃，不建议用它运行游戏。";
