"When Husk opens again it shows what happened, with a report you can share. Usually the game ran out of memory or hit something Husk does not support yet. Close other apps, and share the report if it keeps happening." = "重新打开 Husk 后会显示发生的情况，并提供可分享的报告。通常是游戏内存不足，或使用了 Husk 尚未支持的功能。请先关闭其他应用；如果反复出现，请分享报告。";
"When a new Android image or snapshot is published, Husk asks once whether to download it. Never asked before Android has been downloaded." = "发布新的安卓映像或快照后，Husk 会询问一次是否下载。尚未下载安卓时不会询问。";
"Whenever Android or a game starts, Husk asks TrollStore to enable JIT. TrollStore opens Husk, attaches to it for a moment and lets go, which leaves it allowed to run code it wrote." = "每次启动安卓或游戏时，Husk 都会请求 TrollStore 开启 JIT。TrollStore 会打开 Husk，短暂附加后断开，使其保留运行动态代码的能力。";
