"• **Opens and closes instantly:** the signing certificate has probably expired. Free Apple accounts last 7 days. Re-sign or reinstall Husk with your sideloader; your apps and saves stay.\n• **“Untrusted Developer”:** go to Settings › General › VPN & Device Management and trust your certificate.\n• **Asks for Developer Mode:** turn it on in Settings › Privacy & Security." = "• **打开后立刻退出：** 签名证书可能已过期，免费 Apple 账号签名通常有效 7 天。请使用原侧载工具重新签名或覆盖安装，以保留应用与存档。\n• **提示“不受信任的开发者”：** 前往 设置 › 通用 › VPN 与设备管理，信任你的证书。\n• **要求开发者模式：** 在 设置 › 隐私与安全性 中开启。";
"• **iOS 27 or later:** Settings › JIT › Pair on this iPhone. No computer needed.\n• **iOS 26:** StikJIT (built in) with a pairing file made on a computer, plus LocalDevVPN.\n• **Older iOS, or Husk inside LiveContainer:** the StikDebug app.\n• **Installed with TrollStore:** TrollStore, with its URL Scheme setting on.\n• **Jailbroken with Dopamine:** turn on JIT for apps in the jailbreak's settings." = "• **iOS 27 及以上：** 设置 › JIT › 在此 iPhone 上配对，无需电脑。\n• **iOS 26：** 内置 StikJIT，配合电脑生成的配对文件和 LocalDevVPN。\n• **更早的 iOS，或在 LiveContainer 中运行：** 使用 StikDebug 应用。\n• **通过 TrollStore 安装：** 在 TrollStore 中开启 URL Scheme 设置后使用 TrollStore。\n• **使用 Dopamine 越狱：** 在越狱设置中为应用开启 JIT。";
